    <briefdescription>
<para>On-disk store of calibration files, shared by every HORUS channel node. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Layout: &lt;data_root&gt;/subjects/&lt;subject&gt;/calibration/&lt;node&gt;/&lt;unit&gt;_&lt;YYYYmmdd_HHMMSS_mmm&gt;.yaml. Every save is a new file (history is kept); the latest file of a unit is the newest timestamp. A file holds <computeroutput>node</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>unit</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>plugin</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>created_at</computeroutput> and the plugin&apos;s <computeroutput>data</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
